OL,3,GNEWSADrug dealers jailed after dawn
OL,4,Araids
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo drug dealers have been jailed after
OL,7,Fpolice found #22,000 worth of cocaine
OL,8,Fand heroin, as well as gold jewellery,
OL,9,Fmultiple vehicles and cash at houses in
OL,10,FBradford.
OL,12,FAlfie Leahy, 22, and Connor Broadbent,
OL,13,F26, were sentenced for more than eight
OL,14,Fyears in total at Bradford Crown Court
OL,15,Fon Monday after pleading guilty to the
OL,16,Foffences in August.
OL,18,FThe drugs were discovered during dawn
OL,19,Fraids on 17 July at Leahy's home in
OL,20,FDawson Street and a property on
OL,21,FGrayswood Crescent in Holme Wood.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
